Package: gnome-shell-extension-gradia-capture
Version: 0.1.0
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Gitii <gitii@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 46~), gnome-shell (<< 47~), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.4), gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.12), gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0, gir1.2-pango-1.0
Suggests: flatpak, xdg-desktop-portal-gnome
Homepage: https://github.com/Gitii/gradia-capture
Description: Screenshot annotations for GNOME Shell 46 (proof of concept)
 Adds drawing tools and custom saving options to GNOME's screenshot overlay.
 Optional Gradia Flatpak integration provides editing and OCR.
 This package contains a GNOME 46 backport of upstream commit f70a212.
